:: WakingUp1
    <img class="scene" src="img/locations/university_admin_clinic.jpg" alt="medical wing photo"/>

    You feel uneasy. Not yet able to make sense of it, you know something is strange. As you slowly wake up, you know you aren't anywhere you remember ever being before. The smell is unfamiliar. The bed you are laying in, is different. Even the air feels different. Thicker, maybe?

    You slowly open your eyes, feeling groggy and disoriented.

    The room is dimly lit, yet richly decorated. Full of reds and stained wood. And it's cavernous with high ceilings. The light is provided by numerous candles arranged on shelves and bedside tables. Come to think of it, there are a lot of beds here.

    Before you're able to make sense of anything you are seeing, the large wooden doors to the room open. A woman wearing a white robe and hood is walking across the black marble floor and snacking on a bread roll. This is all so strange.

    She notices you are awake.

    <<speech "amy">>Oh good, you are awake!<</speech>>\

    <<button [[Continue | WakingUp2]]>><</button>>

:: WakingUp2
    <img class="scene" src="img/locations/university_admin_clinic.jpg" alt="medical wing photo"/>

    <<speech "amy">>
        My name is $npcs.amy.name.formal, and I am the Mendicant for this school. I am terribly sorry I was wasn't here when you woke, no doubt you are rather confused.
    <</speech>>\

    <<speech "amy">>
        And while you surely has questions, I'm afraid it is not my place to answer them. For that you'll need to speak with Dean Sullivan. He will be quite pleased you are back in the world of the living.
    <</speech>>\

    She proceeds to stand over you and holds her hands above your chest. She says words. But what she says makes zero sense to you, almost as if she is speaking gibberish or a foreign language. Latin maybe? Sounds a little familiar.

    To add to your confusion, there are floating candles. No, like legitimate floating candles just sitting in the middle of the air. Maybe $npcs.amy.name.formal is right, you are just confused. Very, very confused.

    <<button [[Continue | WakingUp3]]>><</button>>

:: WakingUp3
    <img class="scene" src="img/locations/university_admin_clinic.jpg" alt="medical wing photo"/>

    $npcs.amy.name.formal sees you staring at the candles.

    <<speech "amy">>I know, more questions right? Truely, I would love to answer them, but give us just a few minutes longer. I do have some good news though, you are very healthy and aside from that confusion written on forehead and maybe some grogginess, you will be just fine.<</speech>>\

    <<button [[Someone enters the room | WakingUp4]]>><</button>>

:: WakingUp4
    <img class="scene" src="img/locations/university_admin_clinic.jpg" alt="medical wing photo"/>\

    You see $npcs.amy.name.formal wave her hands around in a series of small circular motions while speaking that same latin like gibberish again. Suddenly, a barely visible, transparent blue orb appears in front of her and floats out of the room and through the closed door.

    <<speech "amy">>
        Someone will be along shortly to show you the way to the dean's office.
    <</speech>>\

    With you brain fog still in full force, you are as perplexed as ever. A few seconds later a young woman opens the large wooden doors to the room. She briefly looks at you before speaking to $npcs.amy.name.formal.

    <<speech "janessa">>
        You called for me $npcs.amy.name.title? I assume the dean is expecting him?
    <</speech>>
    <<speech "amy">>
        Good evening $npcs.janessa.name.formal. And yes, you and this one are expected in the dean's office.
    <</speech>>\

    $npcs.amy.name.formal looks at you.

    <<speech "amy">>This is $npcs.janessa.name.firstName, she will escort you to the dean. Please have someone bring you back here if your grogginess sticks around for than a day or two. And if you have any other medical needs, I will be right here for you.<</speech>>\

    <<speech "amy">>Please, do take care of yourself.<</speech>>\
    <<tone "pos">>There is more than a hint of pity in her voice.<</tone>>

    $npcs.amy.name.formal walks over to $npcs.janessa.name.firstName and speaks with her quietly. You cannot hear what either one is saying, but $npcs.janessa.name.firstName appears annoyed by whatever it is.

    <<speech "janessa">>Lets go.<</speech>>\

    For the first time since you woke up, you roll onto your side and place your bare feet on the cold slate floor.

    After noticing the strange red gown you are wearing (and pushing aside the question of who undressed and redressed you or why are wearing this crazy outfit), you notice a mirror next to the headboard of the bed. Your first glance suprises you. You look...different. 
    
    And you might even like it:

